    "work_id": "gez-anaphoras/athanasios",
    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Athanasios.0034",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And we also say together with them, Holy, etc. -_Behold we magnify, behold we praise, behold we honour, behold we exalt, the firstborn among days, which is the holy Christian Sabbath; and let us say, This is the day which the Lord hath made, let us be glad and rejoice in it; and let us sing with Asaph the prophet. Rejoice ye in the Lord who hath helped us. Verily, Jet us rejoice in the Lord who hath bestowed on us free- dom after bondage, light after darkness.",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 380,
    "date_range": [
