    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Athanasios.0045",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And likewise the cup—Thou didst mingle water and wine, didst bless and hallow, and say, Take, drink; this cup is My Blood, from which there is no division. As often as ye eat this bread and drink this cup proclaim My death and My resurrection, and confess My ascen- sion into heaven, hoping for My coming again in glory.",
