    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Athanasios.0048",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "collar of fire, and let them be dragged thereby, and come to grievous woe; and all those who hate Thy holy name, draw Thy sword and encircle them, and let the earth whereon they tread engulf and devour them and let them go down alive into Sheol.",
