    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Athanasios.0049",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But as for us who have been persecuted for Thy name’s sake, show us Thy compassion, for ravenous ‘wolves’! have been multipiied who spare not the flock. Do Thou uniting give to them all, sanctifying one by the other. O Son, cry aloud, as He who suffered, and say, elmdsh lama sabagtdni; and while it is still in their mouths, say, Abba, Father, have mercy on those who have eaten My",
